.TH AERO-PROFILE 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-profile \- Hardware energy governor and dynamic frequency coordinator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-profile
[BsetR IProfileR] [B\-\-statusR] [B\-\-helpR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-profile
manages hardware power states, energy performance preferences (EPP), and CPU governor policies
across AC and battery power transitions on Aero Linux workstations.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-status
Display current hardware governor state, core frequencies, and battery health thresholds.
.TP
.B set IProfileR
Switch to the specified power profile: powersave, balanced, or performance.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display brief usage synopsis and available profile commands.
